      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_entry_must_match_live_xref_slot_before_clear",
      "fine_trace_step": 6,
      "description": "After `dict.dictLookup(\"Length\", recursion)` may reconstruct the xref and free the old `entries` array, `makeStream` still executes `entry->setFlag(XRefEntry::Parsing, false)` on the cached pointer instead of reacquiring `entry` from `xref->getEntry(objNum, false)`."
    },
